<li id=\"menu-item-191\" class=\"trp-language-switcher-container menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-language_switcher menu-item-has-children current-language-menu-item menu-item-191\"><a href=\"https://gateway-hotel.co.jp/en/faq\"><span data-no-translation><span class=\"trp-ls-language-name\">EN</span></span></a>\n<ul class=\"sub-menu\">\n\t<li id=\"menu-item-190\" class=\"trp-language-switcher-container menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-language_switcher menu-item-190\"><a href=\"https://gateway-hotel.co.jp/faq/\"><span data-no-translation><span class=\"trp-ls-language-name\">JA</span></span></a></li>\n\t<li id=\"menu-item-188\" class=\"trp-language-switcher-container menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-language_switcher menu-item-188\"><a href=\"https://gateway-hotel.co.jp/zh/faq/\"><span data-no-translation><span class=\"trp-ls-language-name\">ZH</span></span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>                    </div>\n  </div></li>\n  </ul>\n<input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"menu\" />\n<label for=\"menu\" class=\"menu\"> <span></span> <span></span> <span></span> </label>\n<nav class=\"nav\">\n<div class=\"header_logo\"><a href=\"https://gateway-hotel.co.jp/en/\"><img src=\"https://gateway-hotel.co.jp/wp/wp-content/themes/narita2025/img/logo_on.webp\" alt=\"成田ゲートウェイホテル\"></a></div>\n<nav>\n  <ul class=\"head_menu\">\n    <li><a href=\"https://gateway-hotel.co.jp/en/room\">Accommodation</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://gateway-hotel.co.jp/en/restaurant\">restaurant</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://gateway-hotel.co.jp/en/guest\">Facility Information</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://gateway-hotel.co.jp/en/access\">access</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://gateway-hotel.co.jp/en/surround\">Tourist Information</a></li>\n\t  <li><div class=\"box_cont add_side sp_none\">\n                    <div class=\"navi-in\"><span class=\"h_icon h_icon5_sp\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-globe\"></i></span>\n                    <ul><li class=\"trp-language-switcher-container menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-language_switcher menu-item-has-children current-language-menu-item menu-item-191\"><a href=\"https://gateway-hotel.co.jp/en/faq\"><span data-no-translation><span class=\"trp-ls-language-name\">EN</span></span></a>\n<ul class=\"sub-menu\">\n\t<li class=\"trp-language-switcher-container menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-language_switcher menu-item-190\"><a href=\"https://gateway-hotel.co.jp/faq/\"><span data-no-translation><span class=\"trp-ls-language-name\">JA</span></span></a></li>\n\t<li class=\"trp-language-switcher-container menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-language_switcher menu-item-188\"><a href=\"https://gateway-hotel.co.jp/zh/faq/\"><span data-no-translation><span class=\"trp-ls-language-name\">ZH</span></span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>                    </div>\n  </div></li>\n    <li>\n      <div class=\"head_btn\"><a href=\"https://gateway-hotel.co.jp/en/inquiry\">inquiry</a></div>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <div class=\"head_btn_blk m_l_2 m_l_0_sp\"><a href=\"https://gateway-hotel.co.jp/en/group-inquiry\">Group Reservation Information</a></div>\n    </li>\n  </ul>\n</nav>\n</div>\n</header>\n      <div class=\"cont_wrap p_0\">\r\n\t<div class=\"page_title_cont bg_p_bestrate\"><div class=\"page_title_box\">FAQ<span>FAQ</span></div></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"cont_sec_wrap\">\r\n  <div class=\"container p_t_3\">\r\n <h3 class=\"cont_title_sub m_b_2 m_t_8\"><div>Questions about accommodation</div></h3>\r\n<section class=\"accordion\">\r\n\t\t<input id=\"block-01\" type=\"checkbox\" class=\"toggle\">\r\n<label class=\"Label\" for=\"block-01\"><p><span>Q.</span>Can I pay by credit card?</p></label>\r\n<div class=\"content\">\r\n  <p><span>A.</span>We accept Visa, Amex, MasterCard, Diners, JCB, Nicos, UC, DC and other cards.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<input id=\"block-02\" type=\"checkbox\" class=\"toggle\">\r\n<label class=\"Label\" for=\"block-02\"><p><span>Q.</span>Can I exchange foreign currency?</p></label>\r\n<div class=\"content\">\r\n  <p><span>A.</span>There is a foreign currency exchange machine in the lobby on the 2nd floor. Other currencies are accepted at the front desk on the 2nd floor, but some currencies may not be accepted. Please note that we do not exchange Japanese yen for foreign currencies.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<input id=\"block-03\" type=\"checkbox\" class=\"toggle\">\r\n<label class=\"Label\" for=\"block-03\"><p><span>Q.</span>What are the check-in and check-out times?</p></label>\r\n<div class=\"content\">\r\n  <p><span>A.</span>Check-in is from 15:00. If you arrive earlier, we will process your check-in and store your luggage. Check-out is at 11:00.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<input id=\"block-04\" type=\"checkbox\" class=\"toggle\">\r\n<label class=\"Label\" for=\"block-04\"><p><span>Q.</span>Can I extend my early check-in/check-out time?</p></label>\r\n<div class=\"content\">\r\n  <p><span>A.</span>The following additional fees will be charged separately.<br>\r\nEarly check-in: 11:00-15:00 is 1,000 yen per hour<br>\r\nLate check-out: 1,000 yen per hour from 11:00 to 15:00<br>\r\n*If you exceed 4 hours in either case, you will be charged the overnight or day use fee.<br>\r\n*Please note that this may not be available depending on room availability.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<input id=\"block-05\" type=\"checkbox\" class=\"toggle\">\r\n<label class=\"Label\" for=\"block-05\"><p><span>Q.</span>Can I specify a room?</p></label>\r\n<div class=\"content\">\r\n  <p><span>A.</span>We will do our best to accommodate your requests, so please let us know.</div>\r\n\r\n<input id=\"block-06\" type=\"checkbox\" class=\"toggle\">\r\n<label class=\"Label\" for=\"block-06\"><p><span>Q.</span>When and how much is the cancellation fee?</p></label>\r\n<div class=\"content\">\r\n  <p><span>A.</span>If you cancel your stay, the following cancellation fees will be charged:<br>\r\nIf you contact us the day before your planned stay: 20%<br>\r\nIf you contact us on the day of your stay: 80%<br>\r\nIf you do not contact us and do not show up: Charge 100%</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<input id=\"block-07\" type=\"checkbox\" class=\"toggle\">\r\n<label class=\"Label\" for=\"block-07\"><p><span>Q.</span>Do you have baby cots available?</p></label>\r\n<div class=\"content\">\r\n  <p><span>A.</span>We have baby cribs available for children up to 12 months old for 2,000 yen each. As the number is limited, please contact us as soon as possible if you require one.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<input id=\"block-08\" type=\"checkbox\" class=\"toggle\">\r\n<label class=\"Label\" for=\"block-08\"><p><span>Q.</span>My child is still small. What is the accommodation fee?</p></label>\r\n<div class=\"content\">\r\n  <p><span>A.</span>If you have a preschool child and do not require a separate bed, and you are able to share a bed with them, the accommodation fee is free. We can also provide an extra bed for 3,000 yen per bed. There are restrictions depending on the room type, so please contact us for more information.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<input id=\"block-09\" type=\"checkbox\" class=\"toggle\">\r\n<label class=\"Label\" for=\"block-09\"><p><span>Q.</span>I would like to invite some friends and family, but how should I pay?</p></label>\r\n<div class=\"content\">\r\n  <p><span>A.</span>We do not accept subsequent billing, so payment must be made in advance by bank transfer, credit card, or cash.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<input id=\"block-10\" type=\"checkbox\" class=\"toggle\">\r\n<label class=\"Label\" for=\"block-10\"><p><span>Q.</span>Can minors stay alone?</p></label>\r\n<div class=\"content\">\r\n  <p><span>A.</span>If you are a minor (under 18 years old) staying alone, you will need a consent form from your guardian. If you are staying with multiple people, please prepare a consent form for each person staying.<br>\r\nPlease download the &quot;Consent Form for Minors&#039; Accommodation&quot; below, have your guardian fill it out, and submit it to the front desk at check-in.<br>\r\n<a href=\"https://gateway-hotel.co.jp/wp/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/未成年者の宿泊同意書.pdf\"\r\n   target=\"_blank\"\r\n   class=\"qa-pdf\">\r\n  ▶︎ Accommodation consent form for minors\r\n</a></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<input id=\"block-11\" type=\"checkbox\" class=\"toggle\">\r\n<label class=\"Label\" for=\"block-11\"><p><span>Q.</span>Can you issue qualified invoices and receipts (invoices)?</p></label>\r\n<div class=\"content\">\r\n  <p><span>A.</span>The hotel will only issue a receipt (invoice) if payment is made on site. Please note that the hotel cannot issue a receipt if payment is made in advance.<br>\r\n                        If you are considering making a reservation with advance payment and require a receipt (invoice), please make your reservation through our hotel website or a domestic reservation site that supports the invoice system (Rakuten, Jalan, etc.).<br>\r\n                        For prepayment receipts, please contact the reservation site where you made your reservation.<br>\r\n                        In addition, overseas booking sites (Booking.com, Expedia, agoda, Trip.com, etc.) do not support qualified invoices and receipts (invoices) in Japan.\r\n        \r\n\t</section>\r\n <h3 class=\"cont_title_sub m_b_2 m_t_5\"><div>Questions about restaurants and bars</div></h3>\r\n<section class=\"accordion\">\r\n\t\t<input id=\"block-12\" type=\"checkbox\" class=\"toggle\">\r\n<label class=\"Label\" for=\"block-12\"><p><span>Q.</span>Do I need to make a reservation for the restaurant in advance?</p></label>\r\n<div class=\"content\">\r\n  <p><span>A.</span>If you have a specific date and time in mind, we recommend making a reservation in advance.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<input id=\"block-13\" type=\"checkbox\" class=\"toggle\">\r\n<label class=\"Label\" for=\"block-13\"><p><span>Q.</span>Are there smoking and non-smoking seats in all restaurants?</p></label>\r\n<div class=\"content\">\r\n  <p><span>A.</span>All seats in the main dining room, &quot;Sense,&quot; are non-smoking.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<input id=\"block-14\" type=\"checkbox\" class=\"toggle\">\r\n<label class=\"Label\" for=\"block-14\"><p><span>Q.</span>Are there any restaurants where I can bring my children?</p></label>\r\n<div class=\"content\">\r\n  <p><span>A.</span>Yes, this is possible at all restaurants.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\t</section>\r\n\t  \r\n <h3 class=\"cont_title_sub m_b_2 m_t_5\"><div>Questions about banquets</div></h3>\r\n<section class=\"accordion\">\r\n\t\t<input id=\"block-21\" type=\"checkbox\" class=\"toggle\">\r\n<label class=\"Label\" for=\"block-21\"><p><span>Q.</span>When can I make a reservation for a party?</p></label>\r\n<div class=\"content\">\r\n  <p><span>A.</span>Reservations can be made up to one year in advance, but please contact us for larger banquets.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<input id=\"block-22\" type=\"checkbox\" class=\"toggle\">\r\n<label class=\"Label\" for=\"block-22\"><p><span>Q.</span>I would like to know where to smoke during banquets.</p></label>\r\n<div class=\"content\">\r\n  <p><span>A.</span>Please use the smoking booth located in the lobby on the 2nd floor.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<input id=\"block-23\" type=\"checkbox\" class=\"toggle\">\r\n<label class=\"Label\" for=\"block-23\"><p><span>Q.</span>Can I use drums, trumpets, and other noise-making devices?</p></label>\r\n<div class=\"content\">\r\n  <p><span>A.</span>We sincerely apologize, but we ask that you refrain from doing so.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\t</section>\r\n\t\r\n\t   <h3 class=\"cont_title_sub m_b_2 m_t_5\"><div>Hotel-wide inquiries</div></h3>\r\n<section class=\"accordion\">\r\n\t\t<input id=\"block-31\" type=\"checkbox\" class=\"toggle\">\r\n<label class=\"Label\" for=\"block-31\"><p><span>Q.</span>Is there parking available? How much does it cost?</p></label>\r\n<div class=\"content\">\r\n  <p><span>A.</span>There is parking available for up to 100 cars.<br>\r\nParking fees (for general vehicles) are usually 400 yen per night from 3:00 PM to 11:00 AM the following day.<br>\r\nIt cannot be used outside of the stay period.<br>\r\nOutside of these hours, an additional fee will be charged.<br>\r\nRestaurant guests can use the parking lot for up to 5 hours free of charge.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<input id=\"block-32\" type=\"checkbox\" class=\"toggle\">\r\n<label class=\"Label\" for=\"block-32\"><p><span>Q.</span>I&#039;d like to go to the airport.</p></label>\r\n<div class=\"content\">\r\n  <p><span>A.</span>There is a free shuttle bus.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<input id=\"block-33\" type=\"checkbox\" class=\"toggle\">\r\n<label class=\"Label\" for=\"block-33\"><p><span>Q.</span>Can you arrange a taxi for me?</p></label>\r\n<div class=\"content\">\r\n  <p><span>A.</span>Please contact the front desk.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<input id=\"block-34\" type=\"checkbox\" class=\"toggle\">\r\n<label class=\"Label\" for=\"block-34\"><p><span>Q.</span>I left something behind inside the building.</p></label>\r\n<div class=\"content\">\r\n  <p><span>A.</span>Any items left behind inside the hotel will be kept at the front desk.<br>\r\nHowever, please note that lost items will be reported to the nearest police station if more than seven days have passed since the item was found.<br>\r\nPlease note that if you wish to have your item shipped, payment on delivery will be required.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<input id=\"block-35\" type=\"checkbox\" class=\"toggle\">\r\n<label class=\"Label\" for=\"block-35\"><p><span>Q.</span>I have trouble walking. Do you have wheelchairs available for rent?</p></label>\r\n<div class=\"content\">\r\n  <p><span>A.</span>Wheelchairs are available free of charge, but please make a reservation in advance as numbers are limited.<br>\r\nPlease ask at the front desk when you wish to use it.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\t</section>\r\n\t</div>\r\n</div>  \n\n<div class=\"bg_bestrate\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\